Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:39.04,ED,,0,0,0,,将会成为最棒的年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:05.70,ED,,0,0,0,,直到我看见你的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:14.20,ED,,0,0,0,,我用双手暖暖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:22.50,ED,,0,0,0,,这杯冷冰的咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:25.70,ED,,0,0,0,,我在等你 女孩 (I'm waiting for you girl)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.70,0:23:29.70,ED,,0,0,0,,自从你出生的那一天起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.70,0:23:38.42,ED,,0,0,0,,我就一直在等待这一天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:41.66,ED,,0,0,0,,等待你的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.66,0:23:45.70,ED,,0,0,0,,时代不断复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.70,0:23:55.18,ED,,0,0,0,,我只想沉溺于你心中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,明天开始就是第三学期了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,（录音按钮的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.22,0:01:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子终于到了2年级的最后一个学期了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一起创造很多快乐的回忆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,新年转眼就过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是今年的新年参拜最糟糕的是大家都把我当成外人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不管怎么说都不能接受的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,游和光希的组合
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……果然还是想做点什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行？这次的连休？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.97,0:03:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯还没决定地点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想仔细看看日本自古以来的建筑物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,想说「带我一起去」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,九州旅行的时候很有气势
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,意识到的话 就害羞的说不出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那么从这里翻译到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得今天没有学习的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 不是游的话游戏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 请认真地做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因为很无聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 只要一点点就可以了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,（铃・游）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行的名单…和谁一起去？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,骗人 是和光希小姐吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子不会多心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定会和光希一起去的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.91,0:04:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,必须想办法…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好好复习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好 游老师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再见（铃）拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,（推音）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,（电话铃声）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 悟史
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你在计划滑雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那就预约我认识的别墅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,当然秋月也会去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？滑雪到底是…（接听电话）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊是接听电话请稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,喂…（银太）你好！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.76,0:05:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,光希在吗？不 松浦也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-我也去滑雪-当然也可以邀请亚梨实
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.73,0:05:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈……和亚梨实一起滑雪的我已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哼哼…（游）啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,下定决心说「带我去」吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 也太大胆了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,游…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,光希旅行你也想一起去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧！想去…在哪里？京都？奈良？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是滑雪…大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.34,0:05:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你要吃吗？吃？不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要跟着你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是很好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太）混蛋！那个和这个有什么关系…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么大不了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,非常整洁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不错的别墅啊（游）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）其实是想和松浦君两个人单独去的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈…那样的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点失望…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是大家一起滑雪也是很开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 好耀眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,（务）哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！白银的斜坡呼唤着我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我一直在等着这个时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你…（游）不会吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,银太！松浦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,滑雪比赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,（游・银太）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,从山顶到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谁下得最快 咱们比比看！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这上面是超难的路线
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,到了那边就不要害怕啊哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,（游·银太）多保重
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！你这混蛋！记住吧 妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,（务）啊……库…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是很能干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太）嘻嘻~！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 没摔倒就下来了 比想象中要好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是运动部的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这样的话 你会跟着我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下！光希快让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让开 让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,诶！哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哇……啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,（激突音）啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太）喂！嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（亚梨实）游！光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哟~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,（铃）哇~！停不下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊！啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.51,0:09:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,（铃）哇~！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,（碰撞的声音）（光希）诶…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.61,0:09:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,只能笔直地滑…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,停法和转弯都不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,（叹气）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我暂时要对小铃进行特训
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……游…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:10:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（亚梨实）嘿嘿！喂！哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,（务）啊…啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里把体重放在右边吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊 一开始大家都是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,松浦和银太都逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人就遭了冷遇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你在做无聊的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哼！看着你们 我很火大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,和女朋友一起去旅行什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,初次参拜时的她是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道地址和电话号码啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别提那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,（亚梨实）2！（光希）3…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！小石川道特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,（务）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,（亚梨实）4！（光希）5！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,（光希・亚梨实）上升！（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,诶……我又是倒数第一？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……等一下吧至少让我赢一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我去喝咖啡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我也喝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不在那边玩奥赛罗吗？（银太）做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,出去一下吗？-嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,铃也去！孩子睡觉的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…真是～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,和我恋爱占卜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我要睡觉了！啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是太可怜了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,明天要不要坐缆车？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有很难的地方但是很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！那就饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行（银太）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…在这里！啊 那里…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太·亚梨实）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…（光希）呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个小鬼啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我喜欢那样的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,天气不怎么好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们晚上还得回去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？我好像忘带钱包了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你真傻 快看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯大家先滑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……大概在这附近…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了…小铃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 游说先去坐那个缆车了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.67,0:15:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜～i
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,游！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈！光希呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,比起那个一起滑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,当小孩子的保姆 我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不是孩子了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？我又不是小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要走很远啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我能滑得很好吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是到了紧要关头就有游了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？游不在…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是先走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,下了好多雪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还是早点结束比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,（游）喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有看见光希吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,从咖啡店出来之后有人看到吗？不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找找
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,即使不大吵大闹 不久就会下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,雪越来越大了 找不到游了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.22,0:17:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得心里不安…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太）糟了 如果就这样变成暴风雪的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,联系救护所比较好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我没有说话！我知道光希在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？在哪里？在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……乘坐那个缆车…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋！那里是又长又难处的路线哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,靠小石川的手臂是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的…我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我想着 如果光希一会不在就好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,铃君…（铃）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何都要去看看（悟史）秋月他们在下面等着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太）「因强风停运」…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,（务）那样…糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…等等松浦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,悟史…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我从附近的别墅借来的 就这样走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（悲鸣）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,光希 一定要没事啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.99,0:19:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还有多久呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,累得走不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 游
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.76,0:19:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！游？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,游！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,游！（游）光希…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…游！游！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…游！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,游！哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……我很不安哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.11,0:20:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,净让我担心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,（叹气）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太好了 平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌……大家都太夸张了 因为太差劲了 所以花了很多时间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起光希
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:20:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,因为铃说谎就变成这样了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙之前吃醋了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.41,0:21:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不用了…已经不介意了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,比起那个 我攻略了非常陡的斜坡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了小铃更新了新记录啊哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,光希…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……松了一口气就饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.34,0:21:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,给我吃些东西吧（游）这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,完全是我输了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,（鼾声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:22:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很不甘心 但是 那两个人果然很般配吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.78,0:22:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都在考虑将来的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.49,0:22:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.49,0:22:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都有自己的目标…好羡慕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.58,0:22:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哟～！我也要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.21,0:22:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,找到自己想做的事 想前进的职业
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.42,0:22:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,橘子酱男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人的将来